* {{homophones|de|Spahn|q=some speakers, chiefly in casual speech}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb}}

# {{lb|de|transitive}} to [[save up]]; to [[accumulate]], to [[put aside]] (for a specific purpose)
#: {{ux|de|Ich '''spare''' mein Geld für ein neues Auto.|I'm '''saving''' my money for a new car.}}
# {{lb|de|transitive}} to [[save]], to [[conserve]] (for example energy)
#: {{ux|de|Die Heizung herunterdrehen, um Energie zu '''sparen'''.|Turn the heat down to '''save''' energy.}}
# {{lb|de|transitive|figuratively|with reflexive dative|often with {{m|de|können}}}} to save, be able to save (as unnecessary or useless), keep something to oneself
#: {{ux|de|Du kannst dir den Atem '''sparen''', er hört nicht auf dich.|You can '''save''' your breath, he's not listening to you.}}
#: {{uxi|de|'''Spar''' dir dein Gesülze!|'''Keep''' your smooth-talk to yourself!}}
# {{lb|de|ditransitive}} to [[save]], to [[spare]] (from effort, an unpleasant or unnecessary task)
#: {{syn|de|ersparen}} {{q|much more common}}
